OL,3,GNEWSA'Like a light switch - I woke up
OL,4,Aand couldn't see'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJodie Akrill had been a mum for four
OL,7,Fmonths when she woke unable to see out
OL,8,Fof her right eye. She said her vision
OL,9,Ffelt like looking out of a car window
OL,10,Fon a rainy day.
OL,12,F"[It was] like a light switch - I just
OL,13,Fwoke up and I couldn't see."
OL,15,FThis wasn't the first time. In her
OL,16,Fthird trimester the 34-year-old
OL,17,Ftemporarily lost her central vision in
OL,18,Fher right eye due to pregnancy-induced
OL,19,Fmaculopathy.
